    "title": "Gonzales High senior earns $10K First Tee scholarship - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Ramirez ,\n7 hours ago GONZALES — Gonzales High senior Melissa Cardenas was awarded the Donna Zoller Memorial Scholarship worth $10,000 from First Tee of Monterey County last Wednesday during a surprise announcement at the school. Cardenas, 17, daughter of Maricela Pacheco and Aurelio Cardenas of Gonzales, worked diligently to be awarded the scholarship... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
